Did you give the box with four holes to the robot?

Did you train the robot to copy the -60?

Did you train the robot to drop the -60 on what's in the first hole?

Did you use Dusty to erase the number in the first hole?

Did you take out and flip the seconds timer over? Did you put the robot and the box on the back?

Did you flip the timer back over and put it back in the box?

OK, here's what I would do.  I'd give the box with four holes to the robot. I'd have him
copy the -60 in the fourth hole and drop it on the first hole. Then I'd give the
robot the box again and wait for Dusty to appear. I'd erase the numbers from
his thought bubble. Then I'd try out the robot by giving him the box. If he's
working right, I'd flip the seconds timer over and put the robot on the back and
then give him the box. I'd put the seconds timer back in the box with three holes
and bring back the box.

